~ Overwold
if RelationManager.decayMet == false:
	set RelationManager.decayMet = true
	=> FirstEncounter
else:
	if RelationManager.GetDecayRep() < 0:
		Decay Devil: You do not care for the dead.
		Decay Devil: You must join them.
		do player.BeginBattle(self)
	else:
		=> Talk2
=> END

~ FirstEncounter
The figure grabs you by your shirt.
Your skin burns, the cloth around its hands corrodes.
Decay Devil: Another cultist here to ruin the sanctity of my precious garden.
- Deny
	{{RelationManager.GetPlayerName()}}: Believe me, I am not a part of their vicious cult.
	The rotten beast looks you over
	if RelationManager.GetDecayRep() >= -3:
		do player.OpenSkillCheck(6, 2)
		if player.GetSkillCheckSuccess() == true
			You quickly cover the carved symbol under your eye.
			Decay Devil: I see.. They have just been desecrating the graves so much recently.
			The devil doesn't seem to have object permanence.
			Decay Devil: They've been gathering human material for their rituals, You can see why I'm on edge.
			=> MakeDeal
		else
			Decay Devil: You carry their sign, You cannot deceive me.
			set RelationManager.SetDecayRep(-5)
			do player.BeginBattle(self)
	else:
		Decay Devil: I have already seen you defile their graves.
		set RelationManager.SetDecayRep(-5)
		do player.BeginBattle(self)
- Push Away
	do player.OpenSkillCheck(6, 0)
	if player.GetSkillCheckSuccess() == true
		You easily push the rotting figure to the floor.
	else: 
		The devil falls to the floor.
		It's hands graze you...
		do player.TakeDamage(9, Global.DamageType.Poison)
	Decay Devil: Go ahead and run...
	Decay Devil: If I ever see you again I'll make you join my garden
	set RelationManager.SetDecayRep(-15)
- Attack
	set RelationManager.SetDecayRep(-25)
	do player.BeginBattle(self)
=> END

~ Talk2
- Compliment [if RelationManager.decayComplimented == false]
	- Her Skin
		{{RelationManager.GetPlayerName()}}: Your skin rot is beautiful.
		Decay Devil: My appearance should be disturbing.
	- Her Passion For The Dead
		{{RelationManager.GetPlayerName()}}: It's lovely that you care so much for the dead.
		Decay Devil: I don't care so much for the dead.
		Decay Devil: It's about the story of their whole lives lived, just to die painfully and forgotten in the bottom of a hole.
		do RelationManager.AdjustDecayRep(5)
	- The Arrangement Of The Graves
		{{RelationManager.GetPlayerName()}}: These graves are beautiful they tell so much.
		Decay Devil: Yesss hehe, This art is what I live for.
		Decay Devil: Each grave in the dirt here is a cultist I found, they told me their stories as they rotted in my hands.
		Decay Devil: Their passions, Their dreams, hopes, reasons that led them to the sea and ended up meeting me down here..
		Decay Devil: and I recreated it all here.
		do RelationManager.SetDecayRep(15)
	set RelationManager.decayComplimented = true
	=> Talk2 
- Why do you care about humans
	{{RelationManager.GetPlayerName()}}: Why does a devil like you care for people.
	Decay Devil: I don't, I think you all deserve to die painful deaths.
	Decay Devil: But it matters so much more after you live to your fullest.
	Decay Devil: And you end up as a remnant of the past.
	=> Talk2
- About The Cult
	Decay Devil: I don't know much, just that the sea cult sealed up this place and made it into their home.
	Decay Devil: They like the easy access to human remains and the underground sea beneath here is perfect for their rituals.
	=> Talk2
- Make Deal [if RelationManager.GetDecayRep() >= 5] => MakeDeal
- Leave 
	Decay Devil: You will ferment into a lovely addition to the garden one day.
=> END

~ MakeDeal
	Decay Devil: I believe you deserve more strength so that you can do more before your lovely death.
	Decay Devil: I'll make you a contract, I'll lend you my power in exchange you must never desecrate a grave or corpse.
	- Agree
		Decay Devil: Perfect, You will be my magnum opus once you pass.
		=> Talk2
	- About
		Decay Devil: My power allows you to rot organic matter with just a touch of your hands.
		Decay Devil: Be aware using it too much may also rot your arms off.
		=> MakeDeal
	- Refuse
		Decay Devil: So Be It.
		=> Talk2
=> END


~ Combat
The rotted lady throws her arms towards you.
- I swear I'm not of the cult
	Decay Devil: I will not listen to your crys.
- I would never mess with any graves
	Decay Devil: I will not listen to your lies.
- Our battle is disturbing the dead
	The devil is distracted looking at the graves nearby worried
- We can make a deal
	Decay Devil: You will make a corpse